OL,3,GNEWSAWinter bed shortfall forecast at
OL,4,Ahospitals
OL,5,
OL,6,FYork and Scarborough hospitals are
OL,7,Ffacing a shortfall of dozens of beds
OL,8,Fthis winter, according to senior
OL,9,Fleaders.
OL,11,FYork and Scarborough Teaching Hospitals
OL,12,FNHS Foundation Trust forecasts a
OL,13,Fshortfall of 52 beds at York Hospital
OL,14,Fand 32 at Scarborough Hospital, based
OL,15,Fon expected winter demand.
OL,17,FThe prediction comes after the
OL,18,Fproportion of patients waiting for more
OL,19,Fthan 12 hours in emergency departments
OL,20,Fat the trust's hospitals more than
OL,21,Fdoubled, from 5.9% in April to 14.6% in
OL,22,FAugust.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
