OL,3,GNEWSAWinter bed shortfall forecast at
OL,4,Ahospitals
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite the predicted shortfall, the
OL,7,Ftrust said plans were in place to
OL,8,Freduce pressure on services and provide
OL,9,Fextra capacity if needed.
